5.6 predict_batch.py
Used: to predict part weight by using input data file (injection_data_new.csv or injection_data_new4columns.csv) and model files (injection_model.keras, scaler.pkl). 
The injection_data_new.csv could be the same as the old, injection_data.csv or be a new set of data file with 5 columns. The injection_data_new4columns.csv can also be used if the part weight is not available i.e. it has only 4 columns. 
The 5 column input file willl also show mean abosolute % error and %prediction error in the console output and add the %error column in the output file batch_predictions.csv. Must have all these files in the same folder.
Input: injection_data_new.csv or injection_data_new4columns.csv, and injection_model.keras, scaler.pkl
Output: batch_predictions.csv 
Command: python3 predict_batch.py


