6. Workflow
- Step 1: Run python3 gendata.py to generate injection_data_for_training.csv (only for training purpose)
- Step 2: Run python3 train_model.py to generate model files injection_model.keras and scaler.pkl
- Step 3: Run python3 predict_manual.py to manually enter parameters and get predicted part weight
- Step 4: Run python3 gendata.py to generate injection_data_new.csv (only for prediction purpose)
- Step 5: Run python3 predict_batch.py to get batch predictions from input data file

